Java: cd Java; javac -d output src/*.java; if ($?) { java -cp output App }
C++:  cd CPP; C:\MinGW\bin\g++.exe src/main.cpp -o output/tms.exe; if ($?) { .\output\tms.exe }
C#:   cd CS; C:\Windows\Microsoft.NET\Framework64\v4.0.30319\csc.exe -out:output/TMS.exe src/*.cs; if ($?) { .\output\TMS.exe }
Python: cd Python; python src/main.py

To run all at once:  Right-click run_all.ps1 → "Run with PowerShell"